# Equinox counters only a spell that would destroy a land its ability's controller controls (CR 608.2): Bot1 aims its
# own Stone Rain at Bot2's Mountain and taps the enchanted Plains targeting it - its own spell may be the target - and
# Stone Rain, destroying only Bot2's land, is not countered.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Equinox
Black Lotus
Stone Rain
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Equinox.Cast(Plains)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Stone Rain.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate(Stack.Stone Rain; Ability: Counter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Mountain
Bot1.Graveyard = Stone Rain; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield = Equinox; Mox Pearl; Plains
